sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Store
    participant R as Redis
    participant N as notify ch
    C->>H: GET ?offset=now and live=long-poll
    H->>N: SUBSCRIBE ds:notify:p and confirm
    H->>S: ReadPage · authoritative first logical read
    S->>R: EVALSHA read.lua · metadata only · never :prod
    R-->>S: empty page + typed root snapshot
    S-->>H: tail · type · closed · incarnation
    Note over H,S: no immediate attach recheck · registration preceded the atomic page
    Note over H: block · wake on a/c/d · 1 s poll · 30 s timeout
    N-->>H: message 'a' — a concurrent append published it
    H->>S: recheck durable state
    S->>R: ReadPage NoTouch · authoritative wake page
    S-->>H: ReadWaitResult · page + timedOut
    H-->>C: 200 data · or 204 Up-To-Date
    Note over H,S: numeric offsets keep read → subscribe → no-touch attach recheck
    Note over H,R: no Store.Get after wait · no producer hash read · only the first page may renew a sliding TTL
